    "title": "These Stadiums Are Big Enough to Hold Entire South Dakota Cities - NewsBreak",
    "text": "South Dakota\nThese Stadiums Are Big Enough to Hold Entire South Dakota Cities\nBy Ben Kuhns,\n10 hours agoThe size of sports stadiums always blows my mind. I almost can't wrap my mind around a structure that can hold so many people. Michigan Stadium in Ann Arbor, Michigan, where the University of Michigan plays football, has a capacity of 107,601! I may be too small town to really get that. All those people in one place, can you imagine the parking?",
